title: A Markdown page, the console and a picker of themes follow a switch to a light theme while they are open, and back
folders: typescript

wait 3000
preview README.md
wait 2000
console echo -e "\e[31mred\e[0m \e[32mgreen\e[0m \e[33myellow\e[0m \e[34mblue\e[0m \e[37mwhite\e[0m \e[90mgrey\e[0m"
wait 2500
mark dark-pages
wait 400
theme daylight
wait 1500
mark daylight-pages
wait 400
theme contrast-light
wait 1500
mark contrast-light-pages
wait 400
theme linen
wait 1500
mark linen-pages
wait 400
theme midnight
wait 1500
mark midnight-pages
wait 400
quit
